,"source":"#{italic}#'Of pride we accepted no equals, and of greed we accepted no servitude. We made for ourselves terrible weapons - the Godslayers - and nine were chosen to wield them.'#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#出于骄傲，我们不接受任何与我们平起平坐者；出于贪婪，我们不接受任何奴役。我们为自己打造了可怕的弑神武器，并选出九名弑神者来使用它们。#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"98f083580242b30cef9ee42756a5ccd0993061ac42b164c61223799e36a4cb9e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"44021170f8bf883c5e41d11772b862b26001f7f7b071c866fb647779c5be61e3","logical_entry_identity":"4517d90b067b7ded6b1ec6e0a9f89332ab14cbf8d4b5fd57e7273508b11cb5f7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All sustainable talents you can currently use.","source_tag":"_t","target":"当前你可以使用的所有持续技能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2020ddcde9c7f75563e8b4def7fff20871951435d3a4fc2ec5f94f96ac6c14ee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"44029f4bc65a0542cd4a481708c0d53a3734193a8f03cfffb3e8192a3de4ccdf","logical_entry_identity":"9b223d1ccf48ec8742fe4f74d1372492dd7b68f0a27627203fb5c323eea80b1f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bloodcasting","source_tag":"talent name","target":"血祭施法"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"76d5447bdf3f877d64211c4f1520891fed96759571a48af09772b104501bd10b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4403eb60628ec6d5e390b28682d6b1bd3958e4f37bc00a8f5c8419c20fe7430a","logical_entry_identity":"d64a770bd9afbbe14ca271597d6f798c3832429634e5dfbd6bde4d6cca0ee59a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"When a single hit deals more than %d%% of your maximum life another you appears and takes %d%% of the damage as well as %d%% of all damage you take for the next %d turns.\n\t\tThe clone is out of phase with this reality and deals 50%% less damage but its arrows will pass through friendly targets.\n\t\tThis talent has a cooldown.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当单次攻击对你造成了最大生命值 %d%% 以上的伤害时，另一个你出现，吸收这次伤害的 %d%%，并吸收 %d%% 你在接下来 %d 回合中的所有伤害。\n\t\t这个克隆体处于现实位面之外，因此只能造成 50%% 伤害，并且射出的箭矢可以穿过友军。\n\t\t这个技能有冷却时间。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a3f1d3dcdc74c2142c7ee590fc64c370ea5c2fac2f287c179e4345db634b2b70","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4409321225c0e9dc869c7b55af41a51c4bc7b6a6eda0e94fa00389abf81b55ab","logical_entry_identity":"8a8e1093c290cc3e9af565bb692dba98ec17952569d524f20bec5ff32a623816","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Throw Boulder","source_tag":"talent name","target":"投掷巨石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a4695821c31188844ed467cbe5a5736dc32d53b06213206ca61a9a38a32bc23a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"440b5e89ce6e9e92d5e4301e8bd0bb38045915b729a6c58d9aa1cbe6bc8bef43","logical_entry_identity":"0b1c12c37a16a5eb07a0afbb41a2a097951686b0b43fc86c949f63ad5d42c80c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"scintillating crystal","source_tag":"_t","target":"闪耀的水晶"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8cf0155b3ac245ca0e381017e6dee2069a8b0b498643a4cae4f5a3eaf6cbda44","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4411e8d88f34fb77d154e7d96b77b918d7ada2950878007d7cd05bec31b8a210","logical_entry_identity":"a39de9db9f39ab324d4b34f63a0177af146a756ce90d638d447b0064ff6c9426","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Creates a temporal storm for %d to %d turns that deals between %0.2f and %0.2f temporal damage each turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"召唤一场时空风暴 %d ~ %d 回合，每回合造成 %0.2f ~ %0.2f 时空伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d73b0a8de76541403487f8c1172f3cf2f28199017d2217864d8ead52742c325","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"441492936083be9c7560e1ba362a13bfd856b25cf4e44692cd72ba7ddf023551","logical_entry_identity":"eeb82e09165032f667290b1a347cfce1ee50ee453072540e942d94c2a2073cf1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Quick","source_tag":"_t","target":"+提速"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50d312a58600602ec111cd8f07e99c42810f1fe03fb9ff6a1f2c35a4ba432e1b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"44216ddcb46dcf6e16d5f4d559693afefc4f71190563228688ef3dba080b2ced","logical_entry_identity":"5e9710ae38ffb1e404f465bfa75b0b36bf3820f2f50513315867a59b6d4cc9de","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have no feedback to start a feedback loop!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你没有反馈值，不能这么做！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c71822feb757d5844f95ae63e23e04bf417e197b76f33bdec98ba6a03507097e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"442378e7049839f095232a0ee930ba1695ef32aaced57e36c954f5ffb641e0fb","logical_entry_identity":"f3cd93b7ea160af43ebb7e93175f7d4a9a50b2227fffbcd380463e4270bee5d0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Instantly grow a moss circle of radius %d at your feet.\n\t\tEach turn the moss deals %0.2f nature damage to each foe within its radius.\n\t\tThis moss is very slippery and causes affected foes to have a %d%% chance of failing to perform complex actions.\n\t\tThe moss lasts %d turns.\n\t\tMoss talents are instant but place all other moss talents on cooldown for 3 turns.\n\t\tThe damage and the chance to apply the slippery effect increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你的脚下，半径 %d 的范围内生长出苔藓。\n\t\t每回合苔藓对半径内的敌人会造成 %0.2f 点自然伤害。\n\t\t这种苔藓十分光滑，会使所有受影响的敌人有 %d%% 概率不能做出复杂行动。\n\t\t苔藓持续 %d 个回合。\n\t\t苔藓系技能无需使用时间，但会让同系其他技能进入 3 回合的冷却。\n\t\t自然伤害和复杂行动失败几率受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7ceb16e055cad56057c62bbd7b0117790f5b1fc8c5dd24e3c44ed08c863dcb3a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"442893b1c0a05a8659d9279760ef1f510b824287bba394bd20b33b3826a110b5","logical_entry_identity":"dacb6888b7c0fea10e1ba3689ed8ba91e9502c40f45cd1d1d0808b84bff37adf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dimensional Shift","source_tag":"talent name","target":"时空流转"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"21358e478a512fa0ef4825de43b52b2d118ffd2274f008d82f05d5c9067fce52","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"442b299d0acc3e0a25f28ae28b7f91940f91860be73d39f827f587aec53f2ca3","logical_entry_identity":"c870bfb2d95077b8414ababef45f122c355171c5005b722221b6c11643c0d547","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Tar